{
  "category": "Drill Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Protected by an armor-like hide, it is capable of living in molten lava of 3,600 degrees.",
      "version": "red"
    },
    {
      "text": "Protected by an armor-like hide, it is capable of living in molten lava of 3,600 degrees.",
      "version": "blue"
    },
    {
      "text": "Walks on its hind legs. Shows signs of intelligence. Its armor-like hide even repels molten lava.",
      "version": "yellow"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its rugged hide protects it from even the heat of lava. However, the hide also makes it insensitive.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its brain developed when it began walking on hind legs. Its thick hide protects it even in magma.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "By lightly spinning its drill- like horn, it can easily shatter even a diamond in the rough.",
      "version": "crystal"
    },
    {
      "text": "RHYDON’s horn can crush even uncut diamonds. One sweeping blow of its tail can topple a building. This POKéMON’s hide is extremely tough. Even direct cannon hits don’t leave a scratch.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "RHYDON has a horn that serves as a drill. It is used for destroying rocks and boulders. This POKéMON occasionally rams into streams of magma, but the armor-like hide prevents it from feeling the heat.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its horn, which rotates like a drill, destroys tall buildings with one strike. It stands on its hind legs, and its brain is well developed.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "It begins walking on its hind legs after evolution. It can punch holes through boulders with its horn.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "Protected by an armor-like hide, it is capable of living in molten lava of 3,600 degrees Fahrenheit.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its brain developed after it stood up on its hind legs. Its drill horn bores tunnels through solid rock.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its brain developed after it stood up on its hind legs. Its drill horn bores tunnels through solid rock.",
      "version": "pearl"
    },
    {
      "text": "Standing on its hind legs freed its forelegs and made it smarter. It is very forgetful, however.",
